  "name": "Lingering Link",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, your links are durable enough to survive briefly being severed from your aura. If a creature would leave your aura, you may treat the creature as if it were still in your aura or allow the link to break. If you treat the creature as if it were in your aura, then you must end your turn with the creature in your aura, or the link breaks.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
